边 · 梅花书架 透格攒斗，适合留给真正想被看见的东西：几本常翻的书、一件小瓷、一册未读完的帖。放在窗边，光穿过格纹落在器物上，比通顶开放书架更有分寸感。📍茶室 / 客厅 · 鼓桌鼓凳六件套 一桌五凳，是最\"拆得开\"的组合：团聚时围坐，日常把鼓凳推进桌下，或单拎一只当边几、搁花器。客人多的时候，它也是家里唯一能立刻腾出五个位置的家具。📍卧房 · 大红酸枝梳妆台 不是每个人都需要一间衣帽间，但都值得拥有完整的\"出门前十分钟\"。妆台配同色小凳，抽屉分格收纳首饰与香氛，镜架雕花落在晨光里，是家里最柔软的一个角落。不必成套，不必大房。选对位置，一件木作也能住进日常。 #伍氏大观园 #中式家具 #新中式装修 #红木家具 #小户型中式 #家具搭配 #中式收纳 #茶室布置 #梳妆台 #东方美学","published_at":"2026-10-15T01:34:50.000Z","views":117,"period_views":null,"likes":1,"comments":0,"shares":0,"thumbnail_url":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn.com/tos-useast5-p-85c255-tx/oEQvN3CYAIGCcpjf4PIKMgB15h1iiBdBAwjbLa~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=14577&idc=my&ps=13740610&refresh_token=18ec2308&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1792094400&x-signature=SfbYUcmjJ0mRUhElnvKnMbZy8P8%3D","native_category_ids":[],"sound":{"sound_id":"7696702099732204301","title":"original sound - Ng.Garden","author":"Ng.Garden","video_count":1,"duration_seconds":7,"daily_growth":null,"is_original":true}},{"content_id":"7690807211920035079","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@user6804406100808/video/7690807211920035079","creator_id":"7587299507538461708","creator_name":"魯班工場-鞋櫃","creator_handle":"user6804406100808","creator_url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@user6804406100808","creator_followers":2507,"title":"#熱門 #好物分享 #好物推薦 #書櫃 #家具","published_at":"2026-09-29T04:20:00.000Z","views":1449,"period_views":null,"likes":14,"comments":0,"shares":4,"thumbnail_url":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn.com/tos-alisg-p-0037/oIkAmLFuIkdXO6HP7riYF5I2WEs8iBaAPbQYB~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=14577&idc=my&ps=13740610&refresh_token=b8036b85&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1792094400&x-signature=h8aDmYbwvsOCS6aVuDcRaitkG6g%3D","native_category_ids":[],"sound":{"sound_id":"7690807284302416660","title":"original sound - 魯班工場-鞋櫃","author":"魯班工場-鞋櫃","video_count":1,"duration_seconds":24,"daily_growth":null,"is_original":true}},{"content_id":"769676